      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "find_dagger",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 11,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22find_dagger%22%2C%22first_time_only%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22How%20odd.%20Someone%20has%20carved%20a%20crude%20fountain%20out%20of%20the%20stone%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20passage.%20The%20freezing%20water%20pours%20out%20into%20a%20large%20pool.%20At%20the%20bottom%20of%20the%20pool%20I%20can%20see%20a%20skeleton%20still%20gripping%20a%20sword.%20The%20blade%20seems%20to%20glow%20faintly%20blue.%20The%20pool%20isn%E2%80%99t%20very%20deep%2C%20I%20could%20easily%20wade%20in%20and%20pick%20it%20up.%20But%20someone%20else%20has%20carved%20a%20crude%20message%20in%20the%20wall.%20%3Ci%3E%E2%80%9CIf%20you%20dare%20to%20take%20this%20blade%20here%2C%20your%20greatest%20fear%20will%20surely%20appear.%E2%80%9D%3C%2Fi%3E%20It%20looks%20like%20a%20nice%20sword%2C%20but%20do%20I%20dare%20chance%20it%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22I%20fear%20no%20creature%2C%20I%20will%20take%20the%20blade!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22command%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22The%20blade%20is%20chill%20to%20the%20touch%20and%20gives%20off%20a%20cold%20glow.%20I%20wonder%20how%20it%20came%20to%20be%20here.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22ColdBlade%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Cold%20Blade%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22items%2Fcold-sword.png%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22The%20unit%20who%20wields%20this%20blade%20will%20deal%20cold%20damage%20with%20its%20melee%20attack.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2217%22%2C%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22attack%22%2C%22range%22%3A%22melee%22%2C%22set_type%22%3A%22cold%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_item%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2217%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%223%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22Dawarf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Purple%20Abomination%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Purple%20Abomination%22%2C%22female_name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A%2218%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2214%22%2C%22random_traits%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22random_gender%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Purple%20Abomination%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20am%20an%20abomination%2C%20please%20kill%20me.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%E2%80%99ve%20seen%20some%20ugly%20creatures%20in%20my%20day%2C%20but%20that%20thing%20is%20just%20wrong.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Purple%20Abomination%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22The%20voices%20say%20I%20have%20no%20choice%2C%20I%20must%20attack!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22find_dagger%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22I%20don%E2%80%99t%20like%20the%20sound%20of%20this.%20I%E2%80%99m%20out%20of%20here.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                text: _("How odd. Someone has carved a crude fountain out of the stone at the end of the passage. The freezing water pours out into a large pool. At the bottom of the pool I can see a skeleton still gripping a sword. The blade seems to glow faintly blue. The pool isn’t very deep, I could easily wade in and pick it up. But someone else has carved a crude message in the wall. <i>“If you dare to take this blade here, your greatest fear will surely appear.”</i> It looks like a nice sword, but do I dare chance it?"),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("I fear no creature, I will take the blade!"),
                event: "find_dagger_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("I don’t like the sound of this. I’m out of here."),
                event: "find_dagger_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_23",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 2,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22allow_undo%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22This%20is%20the%20end%20of%20the%20line.%20The%20water%20is%20too%20deep%20for%20me%20to%20continue%20any%20further.%20I%E2%80%99m%20freezing%20cold%2C%20wet%2C%20and%20I%20can%E2%80%99t%20see%20a%20thing.%20I%E2%80%99m%20not%20exactly%20sure%20what%20I%E2%80%99m%20doing%20up%20here.%20Some%20strange%20influence%20made%20me%20want%20to%20come%20up%20here%2C%20but%20I%20don%E2%80%99t%20know%20what%20made%20me%20think%20it%20could%20be%20of%20any%20good.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$unit.id",
            text: _("This is the end of the line. The water is too deep for me to continue any further. I’m freezing cold, wet, and I can’t see a thing. I’m not exactly sure what I’m doing up here. Some strange influence made me want to come up here, but I don’t know what made me think it could be of any good."),
          },
        ],
      },
