        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("This passage seems different from the other tunnels and caves. It is wide and smooth and leads sharply downwards. I bet this was the way that Eloh was talking about."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("This is no natural passage, and the walls are too well carved and smooth to be made by orcs. I wouldn’t be surprised if this was once carved out by dwarves. I wonder if there are any still left in these mountains..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I’ll just be happy when I can breathe fresh air again and see the suns and stars. Still, who knows what we’ll encounter deep under the earth?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Well, there’s only one way to find out."),
          },
        ],
